{"seq":4,"slug":"concurrency-patterns","title":"并发模式与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/concurrency-patterns","wordCount":878,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"并发模式与最佳实践\">并发模式与最佳实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在异步编程中，并发控制决定了系统的吞吐量和稳定性。Python asyncio 提供了从简单的 <code>gather</code> 到结构化的 <code>TaskGroup</code> 等多种并发原语，适用于不同复杂度的场景。本文系统介绍主流并发模式及其在生产环境中的最佳实践。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>asyncio 提供的并发原语可以分为三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>任务编排</strong>：<code>gather</code>（收集结果，可选 <code>return_exceptions</code>）与 <code>TaskGroup</code>（结构化并发，任一失败则整体取消）。</li>\n<li><strong>并发度控制</strong>：<code>Semaphore</code> / <code>BoundedSemaphore</code> 限制同时在跑的任务数，防止打爆外部 API。</li>\n<li><strong>协作原语</strong>：<code>Queue</code>（生产者-消费者解耦）、<code>Lock</code> / <code>Event</code> / <code>Condition</code>（共享状态协调）。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>gather</th>\n<th>TaskGroup</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Python 版本</td>\n<td>3.4+</td>\n<td>3.11+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常处理</td>\n<td>可选收集或抛出</td>\n<td>任一失败则全部取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期管理</td>\n<td>无自动取消</td>\n<td>自动取消剩余任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态添加任务</td>\n<td>不支持（预先传入）</td>\n<td>上下文内可继续创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心区别在于<strong>结构化并发</strong>：<code>TaskGroup</code> 保证进入上下文的所有子任务在退出前要么完成、要么被取消，不会留下悬空任务；<code>gather</code> 则不做生命周期兜底。异常处理上必须遵循一条铁律——捕获 <code>CancelledError</code> 后做清理再重新 <code>raise</code>，否则会破坏取消传播。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"asyncio-gather\">asyncio.gather</h2><p>最常用的并发执行方式，将多个协程并行运行并收集结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;&#10;async def fetch(url: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    await asyncio.sleep(1)&#10;    return f&quot;Result from {url}&quot;&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    results = await asyncio.gather(&#10;        fetch(&quot;https://api.a.com&quot;),&#10;        fetch(&quot;https://api.b.com&quot;),&#10;        fetch(&quot;https://api.c.com&quot;),&#10;        return_exceptions=True,&#10;    )&#10;    for r in results:&#10;        if isinstance(r, Exception):&#10;            print(f&quot;Error: {r}&quot;)&#10;        else:&#10;            print(r)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Result from </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.gather(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fetch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.a.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fetch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.b.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fetch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.c.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        return_exceptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Error: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>*coros</code></td>\n<td>可变数量的协程或 Task</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>return_exceptions</code></td>\n<td>True 时异常作为结果返回而非抛出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"taskgroup-python-3-11\">TaskGroup（Python 3.11+）</h2><p>结构化并发的核心原语，确保所有子任务在退出上下文管理器前完成或取消：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def main():&#10;    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:&#10;        task1 = tg.create_task(fetch(&quot;https://api.a.com&quot;))&#10;        task2 = tg.create_task(fetch(&quot;https://api.b.com&quot;))&#10;&#10;    print(task1.result(), task2.result())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.TaskGroup() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tg:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        task1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tg.create_task(fetch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.a.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        task2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tg.create_task(fetch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.b.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task1.result(), task2.result())</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"gather-vs-taskgroup\">gather vs TaskGroup</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>gather</th>\n<th>TaskGroup</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Python 版本</td>\n<td>3.4+</td>\n<td>3.11+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常处理</td>\n<td>可选收集或抛出</td>\n<td>任一失败则全部取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期管理</td>\n<td>无自动取消</td>\n<td>自动取消剩余任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态添加任务</td>\n<td>不支持（预先传入）</td>\n<td>上下文内可继续创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐度</td>\n<td>兼容场景</td>\n<td>新项目首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"信号量控制并发度\">信号量控制并发度</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def rate_limited_fetch(sem: asyncio.Semaphore, url: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    async with sem:&#10;        return await fetch(url)&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    sem = asyncio.Semaphore(10)&#10;    urls = [f&quot;https://api.com/item/{i}&quot; for i in range(100)]&#10;    tasks = [rate_limited_fetch(sem, url) for url in urls]&#10;    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rate_limited_fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sem: asyncio.Semaphore, url: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sem:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fetch(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sem </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.Semaphore(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    urls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.com/item/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tasks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [rate_limited_fetch(sem, url) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urls]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.gather(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tasks)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[100 个任务] --&gt; B[Semaphore=10]&#10;  B --&gt; C[最多 10 个并发执行]&#10;  C --&gt; D[完成一个释放一个]&#10;  D --&gt; B\">graph LR\n  A[100 个任务] --&gt; B[Semaphore=10]\n  B --&gt; C[最多 10 个并发执行]\n  C --&gt; D[完成一个释放一个]\n  D --&gt; B</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"生产者-消费者模式\">生产者-消费者模式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def producer(queue: asyncio.Queue[str]):&#10;    for i in range(20):&#10;        await queue.put(f&quot;item-{i}&quot;)&#10;        await asyncio.sleep(0.1)&#10;    await queue.put(None)&#10;&#10;async def consumer(queue: asyncio.Queue[str], name: str):&#10;    while True:&#10;        item = await queue.get()&#10;        if item is None:&#10;            queue.task_done()&#10;            await queue.put(None)&#10;            break&#10;        print(f&quot;{name} processing {item}&quot;)&#10;        await asyncio.sleep(0.3)&#10;        queue.task_done()&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    queue: asyncio.Queue[str] = asyncio.Queue(maxsize=5)&#10;    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:&#10;        tg.create_task(producer(queue))&#10;        for i in range(3):&#10;            tg.create_task(consumer(queue, f&quot;consumer-{i}&quot;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> producer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queue: asyncio.Queue[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.put(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"item-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.put(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark