=\"async def safe_fetch(url: str) -&gt; str | None:&#10;    try:&#10;        return await fetch(url)&#10;    except aiohttp.ClientError as e:&#10;        print(f&quot;HTTP error for {url}: {e}&quot;)&#10;        return None&#10;    except asyncio.CancelledError:&#10;        print(f&quot;Cancelled: {url}&quot;)&#10;        raise&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:&#10;        tasks = [tg.create_task(safe_fetch(url)) for url in urls]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safe_fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fetch(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiohttp.ClientError </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HTTP error for </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.CancelledError:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Cancelled: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.TaskGroup() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tg:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tasks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [tg.create_task(safe_fetch(url)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urls]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>新项目使用 <code>TaskGroup</code> 替代 <code>gather</code>，获得自动取消和结构化生命周期</li>\n<li>对外部 API 调用使用 <code>Semaphore</code> 控制并发数，避免触发速率限制</li>\n<li>始终处理 <code>CancelledError</code>：做清理后重新 raise</li>\n<li>使用 <code>asyncio.Queue</code> 实现生产者-消费者解耦</li>\n<li>需要跨异步框架兼容时选择 AnyIO 作为抽象层</li>\n<li>避免在异步代码中使用 <code>threading.Lock</code>，应使用 <code>asyncio.Lock</code></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>并发原语分三层：任务编排（gather / TaskGroup）、并发度控制（Semaphore）、协作原语（Queue / Lock / Event）。</li>\n<li><code>TaskGroup</code> 提供结构化并发：任一子任务失败则整体取消，不留悬空任务；新项目优先于 <code>gather</code>。</li>\n<li>对外部 API 用 <code>Semaphore</code> 控制并发数，避免触发速率限制。</li>\n<li>生产者-消费者模式用 <code>asyncio.Queue</code> 解耦，<code>task_done()</code> 与哨兵值负责收尾。</li>\n<li>捕获 <code>CancelledError</code> 后必须清理并重新 <code>raise</code>，保持取消传播。</li>\n<li>跨框架兼容用 Trio / AnyIO；异步代码用 <code>asyncio.Lock</code> 而非 <code>threading.Lock</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并发模式与最佳实践","id":"并发模式与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"asyncio.gather","id":"asyncio-gather"},{"level":2,"text":"TaskGroup（Python 3.11+）","id":"taskgroup-python-3-11"},{"level":3,"text":"gather vs TaskGroup","id":"gather-vs-taskgroup"},{"level":2,"text":"信号量控制并发度","id":"信号量控制并发度"},{"level":2,"text":"生产者-消费者模式","id":"生产者-消费者模式"},{"level":2,"text":"异步锁与同步原语","id":"异步锁与同步原语"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化并发：Trio 与 AnyIO","id":"结构化并发-trio-与-anyio"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处理策略","id":"异常处理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异步 IO 与网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/async-io"},"next":{"title":"装饰器进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/advanced-decorators"}}